id: pm-qrirz8
title: Bound complete macOS nightly validation with two shards
description: "Two unchanged macOS attempts in Nightly39262040130 at460dcba7b reach the existing20-minute job deadline. The second attempt passes packed Node/Bun continuation and has no persistent test failure reported before cancellation. Split complete macOS Node24 validation into two native Vitest shards using the existing Windows matrix mechanism, preserving every test, serial phase, assertions, retry policy, per-test and job deadlines, free standard runners and original first-attempt reliability history."
